@guide A_Hinterlands
@name The Hinterlands (Aerie Peak)
@faction Alliance
@levels 45-49
@zone The Hinterlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Aerie Peak, the Witherbark trolls, Skulk Rock, the Featherbeard chain and the Altar of Zul.
@next Both_SearingGorge

fp Aerie Peak
bind Aerie Peak [area=348,349]
accept Troll Necklace Bounty | Fraggar Thundermantle.
accept Skulk Rock Clean-up
accept Featherbeard's Endorsement | Ambassador Rualeth (draenei).
accept A Gesture of Goodwill
accept Preying on the Predators
accept Witherbark Cages | Gryphon Master Talonaxe.
complete Witherbark Cages | Witherbark trolls' cages around the Hinterlands.
complete Troll Necklace Bounty | Any Witherbark trolls.
complete Preying on the Predators
complete A Gesture of Goodwill
turnin Witherbark Cages
accept The Altar of Zul
complete The Altar of Zul | Explore the altar (trolls are dense here).
turnin The Altar of Zul
complete Featherbeard's Endorsement
turnin Featherbeard's Endorsement
accept In Pursuit of Featherbeard
turnin In Pursuit of Featherbeard
accept Reclaiming the Eggs
turnin Preying on the Predators
turnin A Gesture of Goodwill
complete Reclaiming the Eggs | Gryphon Egg: loot Gryphon Egg.
turnin Reclaiming the Eggs
turnin Troll Necklace Bounty
complete Skulk Rock Clean-up | Oozes at Skulk Rock.
turnin Skulk Rock Clean-up
level 48
train
note Thadius Grimshade is in the Blasted Lands (Nethergarde Keep) - optional detour. Next: the Searing Gorge.
